# The universe's lore, offered to the shared LIBRARY.
#
# This used to be a "Codex" tab of its own, rendering lore.amd through the
# LegendaryMissions documents addon's document_screen - which is the same renderer the
# Library tab uses, over a different hard-coded filename. Two tabs, one idea, and two
# chances to show an empty one: Storm's Beacon loads universe_core for the ENGINE, and
# got a Codex containing nothing the moment OU's lore moved to the OU mission root.
#
# Now it registers instead. Registering is what makes the Library exist, so:
#   * a mission with lore.amd gets a Universe chapter in the Library;
#   * a mission without one gets no chapter, and no tab if nothing else registers;
#   * a mission's own lore sits beside this as an equal chapter rather than needing
#     its own tab.
#
# Resolution is late, so `lore.amd` is found wherever it lives - the consumer mission's
# folder first, so a universe can still ship its own.
lore_register("universe", "Codex", "lore.amd")
